sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Cliente
    participant R as CustomerController
    participant U as MarkCustomerOverdueUseCaseImpl
    participant P as CustomerPersistencePort
    participant Cache as CustomerCachePort (Redis)
    participant M as MongoDB

    C->>R: POST /api/v1/customers/{id}/overdue
    R->>U: markOverdue(id)
    U->>P: findById(id)
    P->>M: findById
    M-->>P: document
    P-->>U: Customer
    U->>U: updateOverdueDebitStatus(true).block()<br/>(status=BLOCKED, hasOverdueDebit=true)
    U->>P: save(customer)
    P->>M: save
    M-->>P: document
    P-->>U: Customer
    U->>Cache: evict(id)
    Cache-->>U: ok (best-effort)
    U-->>R: Customer (BLOCKED)
    R-->>C: 200 OK
